    date "2020-05-07T14:31:47Z"
    title "Doctor reacts to Plandemic"
    description "Hello All I have been sent many Conspiracy theory videos recently and this is first one I have debunked publicly. All my references and research from video are listed below. Please leave  me a question  or comment if you would like to see more.&#10;&#10;new article published May 9th basically backs up everything I say in video (enjoy)&#10;https://www.sciencemag.org/news/2020/05/fact-checking-judy-mikovits-controversial-virologist-attacking-anthony-fauci-viral&#10;&#10;NEW links added by commenters.&#10;Evidence she stole her notebooks&#10;http://blogs.nature.com/news/2011/11/researcher_confesses_to_steali_1.html?fbclid=IwAR2PBVsKsZy6kb810WRFQaSHcHTrEtkY3-PrM87kWeZFbLjd674rb8JrRMw&#10;Evidence she actually proved there was no link between XMRV and CFS&#10;https://www.sciencemag.org/news/2012/09/final-study-confirms-virus-not-implicated-chronic-fatigue-syndrome?fbclid=IwAR3zS2GCCwFyYhvLPkZiULS7ifP_JH4vJc6yV7s-e1l07EjNI_uK4LzX1X8&#10;&#10;Science Journal Retracts her 2011 Paper&#10;https://science.sciencemag.org/content/334/6063/1636.1/tab-pdf&#10;&#10;actual retracted article&#10;https://science.sciencemag.org/content/326/5952/585/tab-pdf&#10;&#10;Letter of concern regarding her research&#10;https://science.sciencemag.org/content/333/6038/35.1&#10;&#10;Snopes article debunking her claims&#10;https://www.snopes.com/fact-check/scientist-vaccine-jailed/&#10;&#10;reporting her firing with cause&#10;https://www.chicagotribune.com/lifestyles/health/chi-chronic-fatigue-syndrome-paper-10032011-story.html&#10;'&#10;Article of her arrest&#10;https://www.chicagotribune.com/nation-world/ct-xpm-2011-11-22-ct-nw-chronic-fatigue-scientist-arrest-20111122-story.html?fbclid=IwAR1Dl32zH-YtCKyHpmpKcQXaJlESDGnwVgNFvSsJrZ41B-2S_gKTj06Uxps&#10;&#10;&#10;Excess Deaths Graphs, Coronavirus&#10;https://www.ft.com/content/6bd88b7d-3386-4543-b2e9-0d5c6fac846c&#10;&#10;Discredited Bakersfield Doctors&#10;https://www.kqed.org/news/11814749/bakersfield-doctors-dubious-covid-19-test-conclusions-spread-like-wildfire&#10;https://www.kget.com/health/coronavirus/joint-statement-issued-by-national-physicians-groups-condemns-reckless-of-two-bakersfield-doctors/&#10;&#10;Italian Doctor Death Toll&#10;https://www.thelocal.it/20200409/more-than-100-doctors-have-now-died-in-italys-coronavirus-outbreakHydroxychloroquine&#10;&#10;https://www.cnn.com/2020/04/21/health/hydroxychloroquine-veterans-study/index.htmlhttps://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7102549/&#10;&#10;Suramin&#10;https://health.ucsd.edu/news/topics/suramin-autism/pages/default.aspx&#10;https://www.thestar.com/life/2018/09/17/larger-trial-of-experimental-autism-drug-planned-for-2019.html&#10;&#10;Flu vaccine article&#10;https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7126676/"
