y OPPORTUNIST&#10;Lyrics by Ibnu SM and Abdi MR&#10;Producer by Rusmana&#10;Co-producer by Aditya Pratama&#10;Mixed by Rusmana&#10;Mastered by Ricky Aprianto (Rostels Records)&#10;&#10;For booking and other inquiries,&#10;email: wovenmvn@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10;&#169; OPPORTUNIST // 2020&#10;&#10;#opportunistid #plandemic"
